    192.19318043101913,
    456.05682095614344
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "ing part of the lungs. They found",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    434.01134907115585,
    192.18181956898079,
    444.01135253906244
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
