    79.15909507057883,
    410.05682581121266,
    118.05681402033024,
    420.05682927911926
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "with",
   "rect": [
    126.89772865988988,
    410.05682581121266,
    144.62500138716263,
    420.05682927911926
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "non-VMI",
   "rect": [
    153.5113594748757,
    410.05682581121266,
    192.0227258855646,
    420.05682927911926
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "features, but certain features varied",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    398.07956418124104,
    192.2045412930575,
    408.0795676491477
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "between VMI energy levels. To our",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    386.0227349021217,
    192.2045412930575,
    396.0227383700284
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "knowledge, no study to date has spe-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    374.04547327215016,
    192.18181956898079,
    384.04547674005676
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906595
  },
  {
   "text": "cifically compared lung nodule ra-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    362.0681700272993,
    192.21591255881566,
    372.06817349520594
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "diomic features between PCCT and",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    350.10226925936604,
    192.19318043101913,
    360.1022727272727
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "EID CT.",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    338.0454399802467,
    83.05681748823685,
    348.0454434481534
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "Contrast-enhanced",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    315.93180292302907,
    139.17045593261716,
    327.931807084517
   ],
   "fontSize": 12.000004161487936
  },
  {
   "text": "Multienergy CT Imaging",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    303.95454129305745,
    163.30681540749285,
    315.95454545454544
   ],
   "fontSize": 12.000004161487993
  },
  {
   "text": "Previous studies have established the",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    290.0681970769709,
    192.1477265791459,
    300.0681901411576
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186697
  },
  {
   "text": "clinical applications and benefits of",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    278.09090423583984,
    192.18181956898079,
    288.0909077037464
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906538
  },
  {
   "text": "multienergy CT in thoracic imaging",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    266.11362179842865,
    192.18181956898079,
    276.11362526633513
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906481
  },
  {
   "text": "using dual-energy CT (70�73), with",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    254.13636016845697,
    192.2045412930575,
    264.1363636363636
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "material classification permitting the",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    242.0795308893377,
    192.1477265791459,
    252.07953435724434
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "reconstruction of VMIs and iodine",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    230.10226925936615,
    192.19318043101913,
    240.10227272727266
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.00000346790651
  },
  {
   "text": "maps. Low-energy VMIs improve the signal of iodinated con-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    218.12500762939447,
    288.4090909090909,
    228.12501109730113
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "trast media; high-energy VMIs decrease calcium and beam-",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    206.15908605402169,
    288.44319430264557,
    216.1590895219282
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.00000346790651
  },
  {
   "text": "hardening artifacts; the use of iodine maps can assist lesion",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    194.1022879860618,
    288.3409049294211,
    204.1022810502486
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186782
  },
  {
   "text": "characterization as a surrogate for pulmonary perfusion; and",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    182.12499514493075,
    288.46591602672225,
    192.12499861283737
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906623
  },
  {
   "text": "virtual noncontrast images may eliminate the need for separate",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    170.14772311123937,
    288.38634837757456,
    180.14772657914588
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.00000346790651
  },
  {
   "text": "noncontrast acquisition (eg, emphysema quantification) (37).",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    158.17045107754797,
    285.15909368341613,
    168.1704545454545
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906538
  },
  {
   "text": "Yalynska et al (43) showed the benefit of PCCT VMIs for",
   "rect": [
    59.97726787220347,
    146.12500346790657,
    288.4204413674094,
    156.12499653209338
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "pulmonary artery imaging, with optimal subjective pulmonary",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    134.1477314342152,
    288.4318334406072,
    144.147724498402
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "embolism visibility at 50 keV, while 70 keV provided less noise",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    122.1704594005238,
    288.3977300470525,
    132.1704524647106
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999993064186796
  },
  {
   "text": "and beam hardening. Using 50-keV VMIs can also reduce the",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    110.19317696311258,
    288.4545551646839,
    120.19318043101921
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "required dose of intravenous contrast material (44), which may",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    98.13636849143288,
    288.4204517711292,
    108.13636155561969
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "be helpful for patients with renal dysfunction. The quality of",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    86.15908605402166,
    288.4318334406072,
    96.1590895219283
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "lung perfusion images from PCCT is superior to dual-source",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    74.18181402033026,
    288.3977300470525,
    84.1818174882369
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "EID CT, with higher spatial resolution, fewer cardiac motion",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    62.215913252397016,
    288.46591602672225,
    72.21590631658383
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "artifacts, and 52% lower radiation dose (74).",
   "rect": [
    47.97727411443536,
    50.15909437699748,
    220.8522761951793,
    60.15908744118429
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "High-pitch multienergy imaging can be performed at dual-",
   "rect": [
    317.8863664106888,
    217.89772796630857,
    546.3295399058948,
    227.8977314342152
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906623
  },
  {
   "text": "source PCCT, which is not possible in dual-source EID CT",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    205.84091949462885,
    546.3409423828124,
    215.8409229625355
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "(Fig 7). Euler et al (45) compared high-pitch dual-source PCCT",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    193.86363705721763,
    546.3863858309658,
    203.86364052512428
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "with high-pitch dual-source EID CT and found that PCCT",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    181.8863546198064,
    546.4204684170809,
    191.88635808771306
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "with multiple VMIs permitted greater aortic contrast-to-noise",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    169.90909298983485,
    546.3181998512961,
    179.90908605402166
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.99999306418681
  },
  {
   "text": "ratio and similar image quality (Fig 8). Saeed et al (46) showed",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    157.86363497647375,
    546.3068389892577,
    167.86363844438026
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.00000346790651
  },
  {
   "text": "that this technique facilitated a 42% reduction in contrast media",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    145.88636294278234,
    546.329581520774,
    155.88636641068888
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906538
  },
  {
   "text": "dose without degradation of image quality. Pannenbecker et al",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    133.90909090909085,
    546.3523032448508,
    143.9090943769975
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906652
  },
  {
   "text": "(75) recently demonstrated that high-pitch multienergy PCCT",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    121.93181887539946,
    546.3409423828124,
    131.9318223433061
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "pulmonary angiography could be performed at half the radiation",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    109.87500000000003,
    546.3409423828124,
    119.87500346790657
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906538
  },
  {
   "text": "and iodine dose (down to 25 mL) compared with routine-pitch",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    97.89772796630854,
    546.3863858309658,
    107.89773143421517
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "dual-source dual-energy EID CT; however, prior studies have",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    85.93181679465556,
    546.4318292791193,
    95.9318202625621
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906538
  },
  {
   "text": "demonstrated acceptable image quality at similar iodine doses",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    73.95454476096418,
    546.2954781272193,
    83.9545482288707
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906524
  },
  {
   "text": "using high-pitch dual-source EID CT. PCCT may potentially",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    61.89772588556464,
    546.3636641068891,
    71.89772935347128
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000003467906637
  },
  {
   "text": "benefit the evaluation of chronic thromboembolic pulmonary",
   "rect": [
    305.89774391867894,
    49.920453851873255,
    546.3409423828124,
    59.920457319779786
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.00000346790653
  },
  {
   "text": "Figure 5:",
   "rect": [
    80.99999167702413,
    556.5909305919299,
    114.6022588556463,
    565.0909257368608
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.499995144930836
  },
  {
   "text": "CT images in an 87-year-old male patient with recurrent marginal zone lymphoma who underwent same-day energy-integrating detec-",
   "rect": [
    122.51137473366475,
    556.7045392123134,
    512.5454573197798,
    564.704531582919
   ],
   "fontSize": 7.999992370605582
  },
  {
   "text": "tor (EID) CT and photon-counting CT (PCCT) (using a prototype PCCT system) in a research study.",
   "rect": [
    80.99999167702413,
    546.6817932128905,
    364.9318209561434,
    554.6817959872159
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325367
  },
  {
   "text": "(A)",
   "rect": [
    366.76137750799,
    546.6817932128905,
    377.92046980424357,
    554.6817959872159
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325367
  },
  {
   "text": "Axial EID CT image with routine reconstruction",
   "rect": [
    379.5909118652343,
    546.6817932128905,
    512.7954587069423,
    554.6817959872159
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325367
  },
  {
   "text": "kernel and 512 matrix.",
   "rect": [
    80.99999167702413,
    536.7386252663351,
    146.15908189253372,
    544.7386280406604
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325253
  },
  {
   "text": "(B)",
   "rect": [
    147.6249972256747,
    536.7386252663351,
    158.04545662619847,
    544.7386280406604
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325253
  },
  {
   "text": "Axial EID CT image with the same reconstruction kernel and 1024 matrix.",
   "rect": [
    159.44318597966972,
    536.7386252663351,
    368.5113664106889,
    544.7386280406604
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325253
  },
  {
   "text": "(C)",
   "rect": [
    370.0909007679332,
    536.7386252663351,
    380.27271964333266,
    544.7386280406604
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325253
  },
  {
   "text": "Axial PCCT image with slightly sharper kernel,",
   "rect": [
    381.72729492187494,
    536.7386252663351,
    512.7159326726738,
    544.7386280406604
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325253
  },
  {
   "text": "1024 matrix, and noise reduction using a proprietary noise reduction algorithm. Note the increased conspicuity of internal image features of the right",
   "rect": [
    80.99999167702413,
    526.7272921475496,
    512.5340548428621,
    534.7272949218749
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325253
  },
  {
   "text": "lower lobe part-solid nodule (solid arrows) and increased sharpness of air bronchograms in the subpleural nodule (dashed arrows). In addition, the",
   "rect": [
    80.99999167702413,
    516.7045565518466,
    512.5909007679331,
    524.7045593261719
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325253
  },
  {
   "text": "nodule border appears sharper for both nodules. All images were reconstructed with an iterative reconstruction strength of 3.",
   "rect": [
    80.99999167702413,
    506.7613573941316,
    440.57951493696726,
    514.7613497647372
   ],
   "fontSize": 7.999992370605639
  },
  {
   "text": "Figure 6:",
   "rect": [
    209.86362804066047,
    310.43181402033025,
    243.80680431019172,
    318.9318195689808
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.500005548650563
  },
  {
   "text": "CT images in a 71-year-old female patient with metastatic thyroid cancer.",
   "rect": [
    251.73864191228688,
    310.534082586115,
    466.55683344060714,
    318.5340853604403
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.00000277432531
  },
  {
   "text": "(A)",
   "rect": [
    468.5568237304687,
    310.534082586115,
    479.7159160267222,
    318.5340853604403
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.00000277432531
  },
  {
   "text": "Axial photon-counting",
   "rect": [
    481.55681263316757,
    310.534082586115,
    545.7727120139381,
    318.5340853604403
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.00000277432531
  },
  {
   "text": "CT image (reconstruction kernel Qr56, 512 matrix) shows several apparently new 1-mm right lower lobe nodules",
   "rect": [
    209.86362804066047,
    300.5113573941317,
    545.4659063165838,
    308.5113497647372
   ],
   "fontSize": 7.999992370605469
  },
  {
   "text": "(white arrow).",
   "rect": [
    209.86362804066047,
    290.57955030961466,
    251.8636217984286,
    298.5795426802202
   ],
   "fontSize": 7.999992370605526
  },
  {
   "text": "(B)",
   "rect": [
    255.18181540749285,
    290.57955030961466,
    265.60227480801666,
    298.5795426802202
   ],
   "fontSize": 7.999992370605526
  },
  {
   "text": "Axial energy-integrating detector (EID) CT image (reconstruction kernel Qr51, 512 matrix)",
   "rect": [
    268.77273559570307,
    290.57955030961466,
    545.5000097101384,
    298.5795426802202
   ],
   "fontSize": 7.999992370605526
  },
  {
   "text": "acquired 3 months earlier. These new nodules were retrospectively seen on the EID CT image as probable vague",
   "rect": [
    209.86362804066047,
    280.55680431019175,
    545.5227106267755,
    288.55680708451695
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325196
  },
  {
   "text": "ground-glass nodules (white arrow), blending in with adjacent atelectasis. The patient was in fact responding favorably",
   "rect": [
    209.86362804066047,
    270.5340895219282,
    545.4999889026988,
    278.53409229625356
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.000002774325367
  },
  {
